# Asteroid Lab invariants (MUST)



채팅 출력은 [shapez2-core.mdc](mdc:.cursor/rules/shapez2-core.mdc) Caveman 6절. **위반·의심**은 **## Risks**에 `invariant:` 접두로 적는다.



TDD·테스트 보호 대상 표: [testing.md § Domain invariants](mdc:documents/ai/manuals/testing.md#domain-invariants-that-must-be-test-protected).



| 주제 | MUST | Test / doc anchor |

|------|------|-------------------|

| **좌표** | `raw_x`/`raw_y` 보존(게임·디코드). 알고리즘·OptimizationInput 이후는 **Server X/Y** only. `raw_x==0` → server 부착 없음. normalize 이후 알고리즘 계층에서 raw↔server 재변환 금지. | [`asteroid_lab_01`](mdc:documents/Algorithm/asteroid_lab_01_optimization_input.md); `test_optimization_input.py` |

| **Replay** | 스키마·append 의미 변경 시 버전·문서. payload **의미 대체** 금지. metrics/NDJSON/artifact는 **algorithm input 금지**. **단일 unified timeline**; 모든 프레임 2D `map_view`. | [`asteroid_lab_09_unified`](mdc:documents/Algorithm/asteroid_lab_09_unified_step_replay.md); `test_manual_snapshot_replay_not_used_as_algorithm_input_doc` |

| **DTO·fingerprint** | 하위 호환. `coord_system` 없이 layout fingerprint 금지. | [`asteroid_server_coords`](mdc:documents/refactory/asteroid_server_coords_layout_fingerprint_2026-05-16.md) |

| **Export** | dense 앵커 export; [`sample_gene_exhaustive_generator`](mdc:django_apps/asteroid_lab/services/sample_gene_exhaustive_generator.py) NWS 배치는 **export 층만** 변경. | [`official_blueprint_canonical_export`](mdc:documents/ai/plans/official_blueprint_canonical_export.md) |

| **Candidate** | placement **commit 금지**. 생성 → local geometry → immediate route probe → reachable만 normal pool. | [`asteroid_lab_03`](mdc:documents/Algorithm/asteroid_lab_03_candidate_generator.md) |

| **Commit** | commit-time **latest `route_domain` re-probe**. `RouteDomainSnapshotBuilder` **단일** 진입. candidate reachable ≠ 최종 증명. | [`asteroid_lab_07`](mdc:documents/Algorithm/asteroid_lab_07_incremental_commit.md); `test_incremental_commit_reprobes_latest_route_domain` |

| **Validation** | read-only assert; route·placement·topology **repair 금지**. | [`asteroid_lab_08`](mdc:documents/Algorithm/asteroid_lab_08_validation.md); [ADR-003](mdc:documents/adr/ADR-003-final-validation-assertion-gate.md) |

| **Unified replay timeline** | 제품 replay **하나**; global monotonic `frame_index`. **두 번째 optimization controller 금지**(목표). dual-track 정책 **폐기**. | `asteroid_lab_09_unified_step_replay`; `test_lab_js_replay_wiring_smoke` |

| **Enums** | `issue_code`·`event_type`·`failure_reason` 등 **StrEnum/const** — 자유 문자열 금지. | Phase DTO 문서; `test_invalid_event_type_rejected` |

| **Docs** | CANON/ACTIVE 구분. 의미 있는 구현 전 플랜·[AGENTS.md](mdc:AGENTS.md) 승인 게이트. | — |



